				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Known malicious SDKs and supply chain incidents (mobile-relevant)\n\nThese are **confirmed incidents** — SDKs or libraries that were either built malicious from the start, compromised via supply chain attacks, or caught exfiltrating data beyond their stated purpose."
			},
			{
