					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Live: Cross-ecosystem mobile SDK scan\n\nThis example queries NVD (OpenSSL, SQLite, libcurl, libwebp) and OSV (OkHttp, Retrofit, log4j, axios, node-forge, dio) for CVEs published in the last 120 days. Deduped across sources. Click into the result to explore by ecosystem, severity, or timeline."
			},
