				},
				"string" : "## Check a native library via NVD CPE\n\nFor C/C++ libraries bundled as native code (OpenSSL, libcurl, SQLite, etc.), use the NVD CPE path. Find CPE identifiers at https://nvd.nist.gov/products/cpe."
