				"string" : "## Quick malicious-only check\n\nIf you just want to know \"is this package name malicious?\", the `queryMaliciousEcosystem:package:` convenience returns only the MAL-* entries. An empty result = clean (in OSSF's database). Non-empty = confirmed malicious."
