				"code" : "| view |\rview := GtPhlowColumnedListView new.\rview items: [ {\r  { 'Jackson Databind'. 'Maven'. 'OSV'. '69'. 'Ubiquitous Android JSON deserialization; 100+ deserialization gadget CVEs over its lifetime' }.\r  { 'Bouncy Castle'. 'Maven'. 'OSV'. '23'. 'Primary third-party crypto lib for Android apps (bcprov-jdk15on); CVE-2020-28052 auth bypass, CVE-2023-33201 LDAP injection' }.\r  { 'ua-parser-js'. 'npm'. 'OSV'. '5'. 'User-agent parsing lib; 7M weekly downloads; 2021 account hijack published cryptominer/stealer' }.\r  { 'XZ Utils'. 'NVD CPE'. 'NVD'. '4'. 'CVE-2024-3094: 2-year social engineering supply chain backdoor targeting SSH; caught days before widespread deployment' }.\r  { 'libpng'. 'NVD CPE'. 'NVD'. '5+'. 'Image decoding; multiple historic buffer overflows; bundled in image processing chains on mobile' }.\r  { 'colors'. 'npm'. 'OSV'. '2'. '2022 maintainer self-sabotaged (infinite loop protestware); broke thousands of RN/Cordova builds' }.\r  { 'faker'. 'npm'. 'OSV'. '1'. 'Same incident as colors — maintainer protest, injected destructive code' }\r} ].\rview column: 'Library' text: [ :row | row at: 1 ] weight: 1.2.\rview column: 'Ecosystem' text: [ :row | row at: 2 ] weight: 0.8.\rview column: 'Source' text: [ :row | row at: 3 ] weight: 0.5.\rview column: 'CVEs' text: [ :row | row at: 4 ] weight: 0.4.\rview column: 'Mobile relevance' text: [ :row | row at: 5 ] weight: 2.5.\rview asElement",
