				"code" : "| view |\rview := GtPhlowColumnedListView new.\rview items: [ {\r  { 'SpinOk'. '2023'. 'Android'. 'Marketing SDK with spyware capabilities — exfiltrated files, clipboard data. Found in 100+ Play Store apps, 421M+ installs. Dr.Web discovery.' }.\r  { 'Goldoson'. '2023'. 'Android'. 'Third-party library performing ad click fraud and harvesting WiFi/Bluetooth/GPS data. Found in 60+ apps, 100M downloads. McAfee discovery.' }.\r  { 'Measurement Systems (Coulus Coelib)'. '2022'. 'Android'. 'SDK harvesting phone numbers, email, GPS, clipboard, scanning home networks. Linked to US intelligence contractors. Found in prayer and utility apps. AppCensus discovery.' }.\r  { 'CocoaPods Trunk vulns'. '2024'. 'iOS'. '1,870 orphaned pods claimable by anyone; RCE on Trunk server; zero-click account takeover. Exposed 3M+ iOS/macOS apps for ~10 years. CVE-2024-38366/38367/38368.' }.\r  { 'XZ Utils backdoor'. '2024'. 'Linux/Android'. 'Maintainer spent 2 years gaining trust, then inserted SSH backdoor. CVE-2024-3094. Caught by Andres Freund days before reaching stable distros.' }.\r  { 'Polyfill.io CDN'. '2024'. 'Mobile web'. 'Domain acquired by new owner who injected malicious redirects targeting mobile users via the JavaScript polyfill CDN. 100K+ sites affected.' }.\r  { 'colors / faker'. '2022'. 'RN / Cordova'. 'Maintainer self-sabotaged: injected infinite loops (colors) and destructive code (faker) as ''protestware''. Broke thousands of CI/CD pipelines.' }.\r  { 'BatMobi'. '2019'. 'Android'. 'Ad SDK with dormant code activation — turned clean apps into adware overnight. Pre-installed on some Xiaomi devices.' }\r} ].\rview column: 'Name' text: [ :row | row at: 1 ] weight: 1.2.\rview column: 'Year' text: [ :row | row at: 2 ] weight: 0.5.\rview column: 'Platform' text: [ :row | row at: 3 ] weight: 0.6.\rview column: 'What happened' text: [ :row | row at: 4 ] weight: 3.5.\rview asElement",
