					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Live: Incident catalog (non-CVE threats)\n\nThese 21 incidents are **not tracked in NVD or OSV** — they're policy violations, espionage, supply chain compromises, and SDK backdoors catalogued from threat research. The catalog is built from {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityIncidentExamples}} and lives entirely offline (no API calls).\n\nClick any row to drill into the incident details. Use the **By category**, **By platform**, and **Timeline** tabs for rollups. Filter chains work: `catalog android category: 'supply chain'`."
